{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to launch a new game simulation in <strong>Edge of Power</strong>, a deep political sandbox where you embody any development scenarios for your own state. Here you can build a state based on strange solutions. Manage the economy, use diplomacy to achieve your goals. Decide whether your citizens will thrive in stability or fall into the abyss of crises \u2014 every decision has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119200/extras/9cac36a4bf3e93e73f72bb09266753bc.poster.avif?t=1761300573\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119200/extras/9cac36a4bf3e93e73f72bb09266753bc.webm?t=1761300573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119200/extras/9cac36a4bf3e93e73f72bb09266753bc.mp4?t=1761300573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a deep economic system with natural and productive resources. Extract raw materials from deposits, build factories and create production chains \u2014 from iron ore mining to the production of nuclear missiles. Manage the workforce, trade with other countries, and discover new deposits to expand the economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119200/extras/80ce3c08d9036ed6bf4ad14fddd739ea.avif?t=1761300573\" width=1532 height=729 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Population</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The population is the basis of any state. Citizens work in enterprises, serve in the army and determine the economic potential of your country. Every decision you make affects their well-being and loyalty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage fronts and armies without micromanaging individual divisions. Draw offensive lines, choose attack tactics and surround enemy troops. The seizure of territories occurs through the accumulation of control \u2014 empty enemy fronts will fall instantly, fortified ones will require time and resources. Equip armies with equipment and equipment, from tanks to ordinary shovels.<strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diplomacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use diplomatic tools to achieve your goals. Make trade deals, form alliances. Every diplomatic decision opens up new opportunities for your country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119200/extras/805adc192968c2e3edc0ed62836032e9.avif?t=1761300573\" width=1532 height=729 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119200?t=1761300573","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119200?t=1761300573","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119200/6f99c475eeaf56782d118bcb3a256e78e6dd2d3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761300573","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119200/6f99c475eeaf56782d118bcb3a256e78e6dd2d3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761300573","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to launch a new game simulation in <strong>Edge of Power</strong>, a deep political sandbox where you embody any development scenarios for your own state. Here you can build a state based on strange solutions. Manage the economy, use diplomacy to achieve your goals. Decide whether your citizens will thrive in stability or fall into the abyss of crises \u2014 every decision has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119200/extras/9cac36a4bf3e93e73f72bb09266753bc.poster.avif?t=1761300573\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119200/extras/9cac36a4bf3e93e73f72bb09266753bc.webm?t=1761300573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119200/extras/9cac36a4bf3e93e73f72bb09266753bc.mp4?t=1761300573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a deep economic system with natural and productive resources. Extract raw materials from deposits, build factories and create production chains \u2014 from iron ore mining to the production of nuclear missiles. Manage the workforce, trade with other countries, and discover new deposits to expand the economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119200/extras/80ce3c08d9036ed6bf4ad14fddd739ea.avif?t=1761300573\" width=1532 height=729 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Population</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The population is the basis of any state. Citizens work in enterprises, serve in the army and determine the economic potential of your country. Every decision you make affects their well-being and loyalty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage fronts and armies without micromanaging individual divisions. Draw offensive lines, choose attack tactics and surround enemy troops. The seizure of territories occurs through the accumulation of control \u2014 empty enemy fronts will fall instantly, fortified ones will require time and resources. Equip armies with equipment and equipment, from tanks to ordinary shovels.<strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diplomacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use diplomatic tools to achieve your goals. Make trade deals, form alliances. Every diplomatic decision opens up new opportunities for your country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119200/extras/805adc192968c2e3edc0ed62836032e9.avif?t=1761300573\" width=1532 height=729 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["David Ius"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119200/3627ba45d335cb0af62316aa68330a120d16e0ad/header.jpg?t=1761300573","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Edge of Power","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires